epers. They maintain the channel markers and an archive of everything the sea has returned.","sourceIds":["bb642e5a-e830-4ad4-9d85-dc6ddda0fdaa"],"truncated":false},{"kind":"Entity","id":"f8da92bd-405f-4e3a-98be-59514c18717f","title":"Glasswater Flats","reason":"Relevant world knowledge","text":"Location. A silver stretch of tidal sand where the horizon seems unusually close. The safest way across is to follow someone who has done it before.","sourceIds":["f8da92bd-405f-4e3a-98be-59514c18717f"],"truncated":false},{"kind":"Entity","id":"1dc0b1cd-5f52-4046-9bf1-93e4673771d7","title":"The Ninth Lantern","reason":"Relevant world knowledge","text":"Location. A decommissioned lighthouse on the headland. Its nine windows look toward nine different stretches of sea. Only eight can be seen from outside.","sourceIds":["1dc0b1cd-5f52-4046-9bf1-93e4673771d7"],"truncated":false},{"kind":"Entity","id":"f770d54f-6d5f-4757-9e07-1014eb65fcc7","title":"Ivo Senn","reason":"Relevant world knowledge","text":"Character. The last keeper of the Ninth Lantern. A patient man with salt-white hair, ink-stained fingers, and a habit of answering questions with questions.","sourceIds":["f770d54f-6d5f-4757-9e07-1014eb65fcc7"],"truncated":false},{"kind":"Fact","id":"4bf262fb-4a04-4213-900c-2fcadef90ef1","title":"The Ninth Lantern","reason":"Public canon","text":"last lit: Seven years ago, on the night Mara left town.","sourceIds":["4bf262fb-4a04-4213-900c-2fcadef90ef1"],"truncated":false},{"kind":"Knowledge","id":"0218fc6d-9f80-4787-a6e0-92df6b650ebe","title":"believes","reason":"This character’s own account; not a canon assertion","text":"The lantern failed because no one could afford to repair it. (stance: believes; confidence: 0.85)","sourceIds":["0218fc6d-9f80-4787-a6e0-92df6b650ebe"],"truncated":false},{"kind":"Relationship","id":"d25808bf-3180-41ad-be77-f408cdfbc54b","title":"born in","reason":"Visible connection","text":"Mara Vale born in Bellwether. ","sourceIds":["d25808bf-3180-41ad-be77-f408cdfbc54b"],"truncated":false},{"kind":"Relationship","id":"ab537e21-a7e0-4f9b-9eb9-16290dfcf3ea","title":"cares for","reason":"Visible connection","text":"Ivo Senn cares for The Ninth Lantern. ","sourceIds":["ab537e21-a7e0-4f9b-9eb9-16290dfcf3ea"],"truncated":false},{"kind":"Relationship","id":"4ec2ae9f-c222-42c8-82ef-1dd95f5861cb","title":"member of","reason":"Visible connection","text":"Ivo Senn member of The Tidekeepers. ","sourceIds":["4ec2ae9f-c222-42c8-82ef-1dd95f5861cb"],"truncated":false},{"kind":"Relationship","id":"60418677-34c5-4aed-b61f-71b8925391f2","title":"navigates","reason":"Visible connection","text":"Nera Moss navigates Glasswater Flats. ","sourceIds":["60418677-34c5-4aed-b61f-71b8925391f2"],"truncated":false},{"kind":"Relationship","id":"288722b1-3586-4cb5-b64e-005ca0290ffb","title":"overlooks","reason":"Visible connection","text":"The Ninth Lantern overlooks Bellwether. ","sourceIds":["288722b1-3586-4cb5-b64e-005ca0290ffb"],"truncated":false},{"kind":"Relationship","id":"f934ed0f-4d29-4cdd-8614-78c9717d9112","title":"old friend of","reason":"Visible connection","text":"Mara Vale old friend of Nera Moss. ","sourceIds":["f934ed0f-4d29-4cdd-8614-78c9717d9112"],"truncated":false}],"approximateTokens":991,"withheld":1,"excluded":[{"id":"843905b1-9e95-4f70-9632-05f9666e3547","kind":"Fact","reason":"Viewpoint lacks a knowledge grant"}],"warnings":[]},"proposalIds":["554395c4-a4ad-4e6a-8527-e7d84dc84a0b","48519c80-6997-413b-bf87-7463c5e4bb76"],"error":"","trace":[{"node":"captureBoundary","authority":"read","outcome":"Completed","createdAt":"2026-09-06T03:12:35.492Z","worldRevision":0,"coordinationVersion":0},{"node":"interpretIntent","authority":"interpret","outcome":"Completed","createdAt":"2026-09-06T03:12:35.625Z","worldRevision":0,"coordinationVersion":0},{"node":"synchronizeCoordinationState","authority":"repair","outcome":"Completed","createdAt":"2026-09-06T03:12:35.741Z","worldRevision":0,"coordinationVersion":0},{"node":"graphRetrieve","auth